                  skos:definition "An acid employed as a catalyst; in sol-gel processing, promotes hydrolysis of alkoxide precursors under acidic conditions"@en ;
                  rdfs:label "Acid catalyst"@en ;
                  skos:altLabel "Acid catalytic agent"@en .


