                          rdfs:comment "Titanium(IV) isopropoxide (TTIP, Ti(OiPr)4), the standard alkoxide precursor for titania aerogels; hydrolyses very rapidly and usually requires chelating agents or acid moderation"@en ;
                          rdfs:label "Titanium isopropoxide"@en ;
                          skos:altLabel "TTIP"@en ,
                                        "Titanium(IV) isopropoxide"@en ;
                          skos:definition "The titanium alkoxide Ti(OC3H7)4, used as a precursor for titania gels"@en .


